OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA somewhat cloudy start then
OL,6,Fbright or sunny spells developing.
OL,7,FMostly dry in the morning but the odd
OL,8,Fshower is possible. Rain likely to
OL,9,Fspread into eastern counties through
OL,10,Fthe afternoon, heavy at times, staying
OL,11,Fdrier in the west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy rain, mainly over
OL,15,Feastern counties with the west
OL,16,Fgenerally drier. Staying rather cloudy
OL,17,Fovernight but the rain largely fading
OL,18,Fout by morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
