OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA quite cloudy start but
OL,6,Fbright or spells developing through
OL,7,Fthe day. Mostly dry but the chance of
OL,8,Fa few showers developing. Becoming
OL,9,Fquite breezy around the Antrim coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,12,For showers at times, perhaps heavy and
OL,13,Fthundery. Occasional drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter spells. Light or moderate
OL,15,Fwinds, likely freshening on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
